, "review": "B养的冲锋枪狗都不玩", "timestamp_created": 1674472082, "timestamp_updated": 1674472082, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 11, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "131393435", "author": {"steamid": "76561198180476111", "personaname": "supersoap", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198180476111/", "num_games_owned": 341, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 583, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 576, "last_played": 1674467573, "avatar": "205d40ba481ef4a69ef0bad0706507d4abc07612"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "能找到朋友联机就很好玩，虽然卡牌要刷，但可以当叮叮人省去这个过程，不想叮的话，打4个小时左右老兵难度后，卡组也可以勉强凑一套打噩梦，玩法和求生不一样，加了卡牌系统，缺点就是4个人分工更明确，不能像求生那么自由，优点就是因为大家都各司一方，大家都得出力，参与感不错，而且每个方向可以玩自己得骚套路。虽然单机带电脑很强，但这个由于机制，所以个人觉得，单人带电脑，没有和真人联机好玩，哪怕就和一个人联机也比全带电脑好玩", "timestamp_created": 1674466662, "timestamp_updated": 1674466662, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}